  "can_do": [
    "I can describe things with adjectives: <i>a big dog, a red bag</i>.",
    "I can say <i>The dog is big</i> and I never add -s to an adjective.",
    "I can use <i>very</i> and <i>really</i> and ask <i>What's it like?</i>"
  ],
  "summary": [
    "An adjective goes <b>before the noun</b> (a big dog) or <b>after be</b> (the dog is big).",
    "Adjectives <b>never take -s</b>: big dogs, not bigs.",
    "Use <b>very</b> or <b>really</b> before an adjective, never much.",
    "Two adjectives: <b>size, then colour</b> — a big black cat.",
    "Ask <b>What's it like?</b> to get a description."
  ]
}
